<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27078" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῐ-μναῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῐ-μνέως</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνᾶ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>worth</i> or
				<i>costing two minae,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίμνεως</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διμναίας</span>
			)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> ἀποτιμήσασθαι</span> to value
				<i>at two minae,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.77
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τιμήσασθαί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					1347a23
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μισθώματα διμναῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DMeretr.</u>
					14.4
				</span></i>
			:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δί̆-μνους</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ουν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				69.13
			</span></i>: Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίμνουν, τό,</span>
			<i>weight of two minae,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				22.1013.55
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
